              subtotal = <span class="font-bold text-rose-700">$1,780</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Result:</span> $1,280 less than the full upgrade for
              work that looks similar to the customer. Being able to show this difference is how you win the job
              honestly when the panel is obsolete but the service is adequate.
            </p>
          </div>

