            <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-4 font-mono text-sm text-slate-700">
              panel $2,200 + meter $250 + conductors 80 × $28 = $2,240<br />
              + mast $350 + permit $600 + labor 20 × $125 = $2,500<br />
              subtotal $8,140 × 1.25 = <span class="font-bold text-rose-700">$10,175</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Result:</span> more than three times the standard job —
